## Related success criteria

Consistent Navigation is closely related to the following:

* [3.2.4 Consistent Identification (AA)](3.2.4.html) requires that repeated functionality has consistent labels.
* [3.2.6 Consistent Help (A)](3.2.6.html) requires that any repeated help options are in a consistent place across pages.